---
// The honest pre-launch trust slot. Autio borrows Costner; Shaka borrows 77k
// ratings; pre-launch, we borrow CANDOR — a short maker's note — and design the
// empty review rail in plain sight for post-launch.
//
// DROP-IN: real early-listener reactions go in `quotes` below — verbatim and
// attributed, NEVER fabricated (the no-fake-metrics posture; research is blunt
// that invented testimonials read as cringe, and 2–3 SPECIFIC real lines beat a
// star count). The moment there's one, the rail flips from the honest empty
// placeholders to real cards and the heading adjusts. Example shape:
//   { stars: 5, quote: 'I cackled at the windshield bit.', who: 'TestFlight rider · June' }
import Icon from '../Icon.astro'

const quotes: { stars: number; quote: string; who: string }[] = []
---

<section class="section founder" id="founder">
  <div class="container">
    <article class="founder__card framed">
      {
        quotes.length ? (
          <>
            <span class="kicker">First riders, unfiltered</span>
            <h2 class="title">A few early reactions. The rest is up to your ears.</h2>
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            <span class="kicker">No reviews yet — here’s the truth instead</span>
            <h2 class="title">Nobody’s rated this yet. It’s not in the store yet.</h2>
          </>
        )
      }
      <p class="founder__body">
        So here’s the honest version: Skipper is a small, stubborn labor of love — one drive, one
        voice, built by someone who got tired of audio tours that read facts at you like a museum
        placard. When real riders have opinions, their words go here. Until then, the only review
        that counts is your own ears, a few scrolls up.
      </p>
      <p class="founder__signoff">— see you at the trailhead. Bring snacks.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--secondary founder__cta" href="#top">
        <Icon name="play" size={18} /> Go back and hear him
      </a>

      {
        quotes.length ? (
          <div class="founder__rail">
            {quotes.map((q) => (
              <figure class="founder__quote">
                <span class="founder__stars founder__stars--lit" aria-hidden="true">
                  {'★'.repeat(Math.max(0, Math.min(5, q.stars)))}
                </span>
                <blockquote class="founder__quotetext">{q.quote}</blockquote>
                <figcaption class="founder__who">— {q.who}</figcaption>
              </figure>
            ))}
          </div>
        ) : (
          /* the future review rail, empty on purpose */
          <div class="founder__rail" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="founder__slot"><span class="founder__stars">★ ★ ★ ★ ★</span><span>first riders, this slot is yours</span></div>
            <div class="founder__slot"><span class="founder__stars">★ ★ ★ ★ ★</span><span>your words go here</span></div>
            <div class="founder__slot"><span class="founder__stars">★ ★ ★ ★ ★</span><span>and here</span></div>
          </div>
        )
      }
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder__card {
    background: var(--surface-raised);
    padding: var(--space-4xl) var(--space-3xl);
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  /* large postmark-stamp watermark */
  .founder__card::before,
  .founder__card::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: -70px;
    top: -70px;
    width: 280px;
    height: 280px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 2.5px dashed var(--keyline);
    opacity: 0.45;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .founder__card::after {
    width: 226px;
    height: 226px;
    right: -43px;
    top: -43px;
    border-style: solid;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }
  .founder__card > * {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .founder__card .kicker {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  .founder__body {
    max-width: 46rem;
    margin: var(--space-xl) auto 0;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-lg);
  }
  .founder__signoff {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent-warm);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-lg);
  }
  .founder__cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }
  .founder__rail {
    margin-top: var(--space-4xl);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  @media (min-width: 46rem) {
    .founder__rail {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
  .founder__slot {
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--track-inactive);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    min-height: 6.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: var(--fs-meta);
  }
  .founder__stars {
    color: var(--track-inactive);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    font-size: var(--fs-meta);
  }
  /* real-quote cards (rendered once `quotes` has entries) */
  .founder__quote {
    border: var(--border-thin) solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .founder__stars--lit {
    color: var(--accent-warm);
  }
  .founder__quotetext {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .founder__who {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: var(--fs-meta);
  }
</style>
